    "snippet": "Monsoon had came to an end in north west India. Satellite imagery on 19th September evening indicating clear weather conditions. IMD had announced withdrawal of SW monsoon from extreme west Rajasthan today. Officially it will withdraw from Punjab, Haryana, Delhi NCR and rest of Rajasthan by early next week.",
