    "link": "https://x.com/allindiaweather/status/2101185559154807185?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Etweet",
    "snippet": "The final hope for the monsoon! A low-pressure system has developed over the Bay of Bengal. It is likely to track towards Odisha and then recurve towards UP, Bihar or northeast India. On its way, it will dump a lot of monsoon rainfall. After this system, rapid monsoon withdrawal is expected from most parts of north, west and central India. Video Courtesy Windy.",
